        "\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{eff}} = -\\frac{1}{4}F_{\\mu\\nu}F^{\\mu\\nu} - \\frac{1}{2\\xi}(\\partial_\\mu A^\\mu)^2 + \\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{ghost}}"
